    "description": "Natural Quartz Crystal Geode\nHollow Druzy Specimen, Cream Tone Exterior\nNatural Geological Formation, Large Scale\nThis impressive natural geode specimen features a heavily textured, botryoidal exterior in a soft cream hue, opening to reveal a hollow interior lined with sparkling druzy crystals. The crystalline structure showcases complex geological processes, making it a distinctive piece for mineral collectors or as a substantial decorative object.\nLarge hollow interior cavity lined with fine crystal druzy\nDistinctive botryoidal textured exterior rind\nSubstantial 6.5 pound weight providing presence and stability\nMeasures approximately 7\" x 6.5\" x 5.5\"\nCondition:\nExcellent natural condition with the crystalline interior well-preserved. The exterior rind shows no structural instability beyond natural geological variations. Druzy crystals are bright and reflective with no significant mineral staining.\nPlease Note:\nThis is a pre-owned item being sold\nas-is\n. We do our best to describe items accurately and include research where possible, but we are not experts in every category. Please note that if the title or description states \"Tested\" that we only test to make sure the unit \"\nPOWERS ON\"\n.\nNo further testing takes place unless stated otherwise and items are considered untested.\nPlease remember all items are used and are sold as is, no refunds.If you have questions, please contact us before bidding.\nFor all vintage clothing, please research sizing before placing a bid.\nItems from different time periods may have measurements that differ from today’s standard sizing.\nCustomer Service:\nReach us via the “Contact Us” link above or by calling\n(540) 361-6550\n. Messages are handled Monday–Friday, 8:00 AM–4:00 PM ET, and we strive to respond within 48 hours.",
